{"notes":"","categories":[],"cookTime":"15min","ingredients":"2 lb chicken thighs, (trimmed and cut into 1-inch pieces)\n1\/2 cup corn starch\n1\/4 cup extra light olive oil, (for frying, plus more as needed)\n2 tbsp minced ginger, (from a 2-inch piece of ginger)\n3 cloves garlic, (or 1 Tbsp grated or finely minced)\n1\/2 tsp red pepper flakes, (or added to taste)\n1 tsp sesame seeds, (optional for garnish)\n# General Tso's Sauce\n1\/2 cup cold water\n5 tbsp low sodium soy sauce\n3 tbsp rice vinegar, (or more to taste)\n1 1\/2 tbsp hoisin sauce\n4 tbsp granulated sugar\n1 1\/2 tbsp corn starch","date":786750424.48681,"totalTime":"30min","prepTime":"15min","link":"https:\/\/natashaskitchen.com\/general-tsos-chicken\/","favorite":false,"yield":"8 servings","id":"natashaskitchen.com\/general-tsos-chicken","text":"General Tso’s Chicken is a Chinese takeout go-to. Make it all in one dish in the comfort of your home for a sweet and spicy treat!","nutrition":"**Serving size** 1 serving\n**Calories** 386 kcal\n**Fat** 26 g\n**Saturated fat** 6 g\n**Unsaturated fat** 18 g\n**Trans fat** 0.1 g\n**Cholesterol** 111 mg\n**Sodium** 502 mg\n**Carbohydrates** 18 g\n**Fiber** 0.4 g\n**Sugar** 7 g\n**Protein** 20 g","title":"General Tso’s Chicken Recipe","images":["\/9j\/4AAQSkZJRgABAQAAAQABAAD\/2wCEABQUFBQVFBcZGRcfIh4iHy4rJycrLkYyNjI2MkZqQk5CQk5Cal5yXVZdcl6phXZ2hanDpJukw+zT0+z\/\/\/\/\/\/\/8BFBQUFBUUFxkZFx8iHiIfLisnJysuRjI2MjYyRmpCTkJCTkJqXnJdVl1yXqmFdnaFqcOkm6TD7NPT7P\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/\/CABEIBwgEsAMBIgACEQEDEQH\/xAAxAAACAwEBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACAwABBAUGAQADAQEBAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAQIDBAX\\\/M6+rldDsH0CdEKLRzdEpJcej7VJHHnOU+JiRqpVuJJW0rUadoXAHbP0FXOvjqXAhCQSSBBugkkCSQBhCEuoF3VhcqAUEglXAqFAqSBJIFSoHU38Ppueq\\/Ppnj0Aek9fq83qTegHDtGPBv5XP0lE3y66DS0GSqtUN2Ag0NpUlixVUkoBbFNlR7Qy0qDQWU8NHqEIoQgawxuZqNLs78abCKRKdOcEraraVZn5t8xgTWPSyTfmklikkHJIFS6CXUC7kCVcAauBVyBJcCrkC7Gwu6sJJAkkCpIFS6B+\\\/UYI14QacWHQyKuNHmg4vTvw77nVdFvipTAjRdlc1Hqc0xZgPMDx5twOEldVLlCno5ZXBA43WiGeikxOZH5N9MyTV127TiaV0G4Tz110m5ooMCUE